  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1a0800cd9d9e7384da3732406d1358da, type: 3}
  m_Name: OldManDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  itemName: Old Man
  dialogueLines:
  - It's so quiet up here at night...
  - It can be so refreshing to leave everything and everyone behind for the comfort
    of the woods
  - However, you must be careful to not lose yourself completely here...
  - I've seen too many young men come out here in search of something or other
  - They all come to the same conclusion, the answer is not a hut in the woods...
